WEBVTT

00:06:58.167 --> 00:07:01.934
They know that suffering is part of life.

00:07:01.958 --> 00:07:04.143
This doesn't mean
they actually welcome it in,

00:07:04.167 --> 00:07:06.018
they're not actually delusional.

00:07:06.042 --> 00:07:09.184
Just that when the tough times come,

00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:10.934
they seem to know

00:07:10.958 --> 00:07:15.893
that suffering is part
of every human existence.

00:07:15.917 --> 00:07:20.434
And knowing this stops you
from feeling discriminated against

00:07:20.458 --> 00:07:22.559
when the tough times come.

00:07:22.583 --> 00:07:24.809
Never once did I find myself thinking,

00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:26.518
"Why me?"

00:07:26.542 --> 00:07:28.309
In fact, I remember thinking,

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:30.268
"Why not me?